","id":3325620708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GOPHk","user":{"login":"DeltateeDev","id":115371940,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuBvpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115371940?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev","html_url":"https://github.com/DeltateeDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltateeDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T21:31:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T21:31:12Z","body":"Oh keeping up with the Vsync makes sense, though I doubt it should work that way because replacing half of real frames with artificial ones messes with things like timers with short wait time, that would work normally if all the frames were real.\n\nBut that's most likely an issue with Nvidia's implementation of the feature instead of Godot's, so thank you!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325620708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329844772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110830#issuecomment-3329844772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110830","id":3329844772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GeWYk","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T16:50:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T16:52:21Z","body":"> Oh keeping up with the Vsync makes sense, though I doubt it should work that way because replacing half of real frames with artificial ones messes with things like timers with short wait time, that would work normally if all the frames were real.\n\nThis is the same behavior as DLSS/FSR/XeSS frame generation when V-Sync is enabled. If you want the base framerate to be as high as possible, you need to disable V-Sync. Even then, it won't be as high as when framegen is disabled due to the GPU overhead required for frame generation.\n\nThis is different from Lossless Scaling frame generation where it will not impact the base framerate if V-Sync is enabled in Lossless Scaling and the GPU can keep up. However, the framegen won't be using all rendered frames, only those that fit within the target V-Sync window.\n\nIt is not possible for Godot to know when external frame generation tools are used, so it can't adjust its FPS counter (it would also be undesired in many cases anyway).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329844772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]